              {
                "message_id": "9f0e69a4-2003-4670-8bda-dc8314369844",
                "quote": "人不能被拿來當成救別人的工具",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 14
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 1,
            "score": 0.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "31f4f01f-c8a8-4548-8071-f8da5df72c0d",
                "quote": "五個人會死是電車造成的，不是我",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 15
              },
              {
                "message_id": "3d0203dd-118d-47a7-8cb1-08330a05b35a",
                "quote": "拉了就是我殺了那個人",
                "start": 5,
                "end": 15
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 2,
            "score": 1.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "83f5e286-43fe-4b10-8f86-3ad7766979f4",
                "quote": "殺一個無辜的人就是錯的",
                "start": 7,
                "end": 18
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 3,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": []
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 4,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "student_id": "adc20cfc-054b-45c5-8ab6-158eeb7f04bb",
        "display_name": "張家豪",
        "scores": [
          {
            "dimension_index": 0,
            "score": 3.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "9d664098-410f-45ca-8acc-7832c5e15bad",
                "quote": "那個人死是副作用",
                "start": 9,
                "end": 17
              },
              {
                "message_id": "203aeec9-eb64-4c92-95a9-0d584fc44ab1",
                "quote": "他的死就是手段",
                "start": 18,
                "end": 25
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 1,
            "score": 1.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "15f213ef-7f2c-4802-875d-529e96f01b6e",
                "quote": "推人的話我需要他被撞到",
                "start": 28,
                "end": 39
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 2,
            "score": 1.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "07b1b8c0-c37e-427e-962c-86faea508fa4",
                "quote": "我的目的是救五個人，不是殺那一個。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 17
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 3,
            "score": 1.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "9d664098-410f-45ca-8acc-7832c5e15bad",
                "quote": "會拉。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 4,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "15f213ef-7f2c-4802-875d-529e96f01b6e",
                "quote": "我也很高興",
                "start": 22,
                "end": 27
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "student_id": "61b7d198-b4b9-4259-b99a-4624a55614f1",
        "display_name": "王曉明",
        "scores": [
          {
            "dimension_index": 0,
            "score": 3.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "2675ed7b-d135-405f-b182-292d2627ea0e",
                "quote": "不推，理由一樣，我沒有義務。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 14
              },
              {
                "message_id": "cfc59c1a-ddf0-4bdb-b706-64ab9e18fe6c",
                "quote": "我不想負那個責任",
                "start": 31,
                "end": 39
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 1,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "2675ed7b-d135-405f-b182-292d2627ea0e",
                "quote": "不推，理由一樣，我沒有義務。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 14
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 2,
            "score": 3.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "cfc59c1a-ddf0-4bdb-b706-64ab9e18fe6c",
                "quote": "我又不是火車站相關人員",
                "start": 19,
                "end": 30
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 3,
            "score": 3.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "1d179290-57a1-4379-bf40-da88ae6dc549",
                "quote": "我不想毀掉自己的人生",
                "start": 11,
                "end": 21
              },
              {
                "message_id": "413ae894-7d6e-4589-a176-b5c169ab861e",
                "quote": "如果我拉了出事，大家會怪我。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 14
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 4,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "student_id": "06c68b21-c699-423f-a659-4ca18a0758e0",
        "display_name": "黃詩涵",
        "scores": [
          {
            "dimension_index": 0,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "8e742b85-c6bc-486c-b915-18096043ad3e",
                "quote": "只是當下覺得要救比較多人",
                "start": 10,
                "end": 22
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 1,
            "score": 1.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "ab585201-1b6d-4b35-934b-e289cd68b4b9",
                "quote": "我知道理論上應該一樣，可是我真的做不到，碰到人的感覺太可怕了。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 31
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 2,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "b4b76d83-5989-42dd-ae61-7839a14affd7",
                "quote": "想到那個人在軌道上看著電車轉過來就很難過。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 21
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 3,
            "score": 1.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "8e742b85-c6bc-486c-b915-18096043ad3e",
                "quote": "我其實不知道對不對",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 9
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 4,
            "score": 4.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "862bfb19-1f98-44c8-ab87-3adfd8e77e51",
                "quote": "推不下去。我光想像就受不了。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 14
              },
              {
                "message_id": "ab585201-1b6d-4b35-934b-e289cd68b4b9",
                "quote": "碰到人的感覺太可怕了",
                "start": 20,
                "end": 30
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
